<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>得治法 - 标签 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://lruihao.cn/tags/%E5%BE%97%E6%B2%BB%E6%B3%95/</link><description>Hugo FixIt 作者，喜欢瞎折腾、造轮子、写东西，分享一些前端开发中的所见、所闻、所思。</description><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha-mt895zhg</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Fri, 19 Jun 2026 15:59:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://lruihao.cn/tags/%E5%BE%97%E6%B2%BB%E6%B3%95/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>失治法</title><link>https://lruihao.cn/posts/5-10-shizhifa/</link><pubDate>Fri, 19 Jun 2026 15:55:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://lruihao.cn/posts/5-10-shizhifa/</guid><category domain="https://lruihao.cn/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%94%E4%B9%A6%E9%9B%86/">卷五书集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“失治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;医者临证误诊误治的种种表现及其纠正法则&lt;/strong&gt;。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;失治源于不知病之真假、虚实、阴阳、寒热而妄治。临证当详察药后反应，及时改弦更张，以补过立功&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>得治法</title><link>https://lruihao.cn/posts/5-9-dezhifa/</link><pubDate>Fri, 19 Jun 2026 10:20:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://lruihao.cn/posts/5-9-dezhifa/</guid><category domain="https://lruihao.cn/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%94%E4%B9%A6%E9%9B%86/">卷五书集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“得治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;临证诊察之道与施治得法之要&lt;/strong&gt;。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;得治者，言治之得法也。因病下药，方能不杀人顷刻。虽无定方，而得其鉴，实为医者之幸&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>